<title>USA: New Jersey EFA, won by First Union. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>New Jersey EFA, won by First Union. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to show First Union, not Smith Barney won the bonds.)</p>
<p>First Union said it won $22.150 million of New Jersey Educational Facilities Auth., Princeton University revenue bonds, 1997 Series E, with a true interest cost of 4.423 percent.</p>
</text>
